# Keep Go sources and golden test data byte-exact on Windows checkouts. core.autocrlf=true would turn
# them into CRLF: gofmt -l would then list every file, and the golden telemetry_rules.xml would differ.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
testdata/** -text
# The web content dgserver embeds and serves (B6): the bytes on the wire must not depend on the checkout.
internal/web/www/** -text
